Kiosk Satellite SIP Native Dialer Lab

Includes Apache-2.0 SDK source files from jxlarrea/kiosk-satellite-plugins.
https://github.com/jxlarrea/kiosk-satellite-plugins

SipMessage.java and SipDigest.java are adapted from meiser79/kiosk-satellite-sip-phone.
AndroidG711.java is adapted from that project's SipAudio.java, with changed package,
outgoing SDP, mute, source filtering and media lifecycle.
https://github.com/meiser79/kiosk-satellite-sip-phone
Original SIP Phone author: Peter Meiser.

The floating dialer, its model, direct outgoing SIP controller and lab tests were
added in this experimental branch. Kiosk Satellite itself is not bundled.
